### Divide two positive numbers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/arithmetic/divide?dividend=10.4&divisor=2

### Divide negative by positive
GET http://localhost:8080/api/arithmetic/divide?dividend=-10&divisor=2

### Divide by zero -> 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/arithmetic/divide?dividend=10&divisor=0

### Non-numeric dividend -> 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/arithmetic/divide?dividend=abc&divisor=2

### Missing divisor -> 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/arithmetic/divide?dividend=10
